  "solution": "<div class=\"tex-center\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/ac8cdc0134f1815a499ca5749ab7f0378fd38de0cef7a6309dad4436a444132b.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div>\t\t\t\n\t\t<ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là hình chiếu của <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> lên mặt phẳng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>. Suy ra góc giữa đường thẳng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> và mặt phẳng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> là góc <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mover><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover></semantics></math>.<br>Xét tam giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> vuông tại <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>A</mi></semantics></math>. Ta có<br><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>tan</mo><mover><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mover><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>45</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>⊥</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> (giả thiết).<br><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>⊥</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⇒</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>⊥</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Do đó <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>⊥</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>. Suy ra góc giữa <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math> và mặt phẳng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> bằng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msup><mn>90</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></semantics></math>.</li><li>Gọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>O</mi></semantics></math> là giao điểm của <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>⊥</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⇒</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>O</mi><mo>⊥</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>O</mi></semantics></math> là hình chiếu của điểm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>B</mi></semantics></math> lên mặt phẳng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>. Do đó hình chiếu của <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></semantics></math> lên mặt phẳng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>O</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.</li></ol>",
